<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px; }
    .card { background: #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; max-width: 500px; margin: auto; }
    .header { color: #d32f2f; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h2 class="header">Payment Unsuccessful</h2>
    <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
    <p>Unfortunately, your payment for <strong><%= serviceTitle %></strong> was not successful. Please try again.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:20px;">Best regards,<br>City Services Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>